---
import SitePageLayout from '../layouts/SitePageLayout.astro';
---

<SitePageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Learn how 305 Discount collects, uses, and protects information when you browse our catalog, contact us, create an account, or place an order."
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only information reasonably necessary to operate 305 Discount, respond to inquiries, process orders, provide delivery support, and maintain the security of our website.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Name and contact details such as email address and phone number.</li>
      <li>Shipping and billing information when an order or delivery is arranged.</li>
      <li>Order details, purchase history, and product inquiries.</li>
      <li>Messages you send through our website, WhatsApp, phone, email, or other support channels.</li>
      <li>Marketing and messaging consent choices.</li>
      <li>Technical information such as IP address, browser type, pages visited, timestamps, and security logs.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>2. Payments</h2>
    <p>305 Discount does not intentionally store full payment card numbers. Electronic payments, when available, are handled by the payment provider configured for checkout and are subject to that provider's own privacy and security terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to product, inventory, financing, delivery, and order inquiries.</li>
      <li>Process, confirm, fulfill, and support orders.</li>
      <li>Send transactional communications you request or that are necessary to service an order.</li>
      <li>Send promotional communications only when the applicable consent has been provided.</li>
      <li>Prevent fraud, maintain security, diagnose errors, and comply with legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>4. Service Providers</h2>
    <p>We may use trusted third parties for ecommerce infrastructure, hosting, payments, analytics, messaging, delivery, and related operations. They receive information only as reasonably necessary to provide those services.</p>
    <p>We do not sell personal information for money.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>5. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
    <p>The website may use essential cookies or similar storage required for sessions, cart functionality, checkout, security, and preferences. If advertising or cross-site tracking technologies are added in the future, this policy and any required consent controls will be updated accordingly.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy and for accounting, tax, fraud-prevention, warranty, dispute-resolution, and legal requirements.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>7. Your Choices and Rights</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Request access to or correction of personal information we maintain about you.</li>
      <li>Request deletion when applicable, subject to legal retention obligations.</li>
      <li>Opt out of promotional communications at any time.</li>
      <li>Adjust browser settings for cookies and local storage, understanding some site functions may stop working.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To make a privacy request, use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or call +1 (954) 254-0056.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>8. Security</h2>
    <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational measures designed to protect information. No internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The current version will be published on this page with an updated date.</p>
  </section>
</SitePageLayout>
